'''Mythical Slab''' (Japanese: '''幻の石板''' ''Illusory Slabstone'') is an {{TCGP|Item}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mythical Island}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Item
|rule=SWSH Item
|effect=Look at the top card of your deck. If that card is a {{e|Psychic}} Pokémon, put it into your hand. If it is not a {{e|Psychic}} Pokémon, put it on the bottom of your deck.
}}

